is</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">801<a name=\"ie-core-vaccine-codes-801\"> </a></td><td>As03 adjuvant</td><td>As03 adjuvant</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">19<a name=\"ie-core-vaccine-codes-19\"> </a></td><td>Bcg</td><td>Bacillus calmette-guerin vaccine</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">27<a name=\"ie-core-vaccine-codes-27\"> </a></td><td>Botulinum antitoxin</td><td>Botulinum antitoxin</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">317<a name=\"ie-core-vaccine-codes-317\"> </a></td><td>Chikungunya live attenuated vaccine, 0.5 ml, pf</td><td>Chikungunya, live attenuated vaccine, 0.5 ml, preservative free</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">173<a name=\"ie-core-vaccine-codes-173\"> </a></td><td>Cholera, bivwc</td><td>Cholera, bivwc</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">174<a name=\"ie-core-vaccine-codes-174\"> </a></td><td>Cholera, live attenuated</td><td>Cholera, live attenuated</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">26<a name=\"ie-core-vaccine-codes-26\"> </a></td><td>Cholera, unspecified formulation</td><td>Cholera vaccine, unspecified formulation</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">172<a name=\"ie-core-vaccine-codes-172\"> </a></td><td>Cholera, wc-rbs</td><td>Cholera, wc-rbs</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">29<a name=\"ie-core-vaccine-codes-29\"> </a></td><td>Cmvig</td><td>Cytomegalovirus immune globulin, intravenous</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">516<a name=\"ie-core-vaccine-codes-516\"> </a></td><td>Cov-2 covid-19 inactivated non-us vaccine product (minhai biotechnology co, kconvac)</td><td>Sars-cov-2 covid-19 inactivated non-us vaccine product (minhai biotechnology co, kconvac)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">518<a name=\"ie-core-vaccine-codes-518\"> </a></td><td>Covid-19 inactivated, non-us vaccine (vla2001, valneva)</td><td>Sars-cov-2 covid-19 inactivated, non-us vaccine (vla2001, valneva)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">510<a na